  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot ge\xE7mi\u015F sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "Ge\xE7mi\u015Fin i\xE7in \"Kupa Alt\u0131l\u0131s\u0131\" kart\u0131n\u0131
    se\xE7tin.\n\nSenin i\xE7in k\xF6t\xFC d\xF6nemlerin b\u0131\xE7ak gibi kesildi\u011Fini
    g\xF6r\xFCyorum. Pozitif enerjisi \xE7ok y\xFCksek baz\u0131 insanlarla \xE7evren
    sar\u0131lmaya ba\u015Flam\u0131\u015F. Aralar\u0131nda yeni tan\u0131\u015Ft\u0131klar\u0131n
    da olmu\u015F ve h\u0131zla yak\u0131nla\u015Fm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n\u0131z {{isim}}.
    Kart\u0131n, bu insanlar\u0131n senin i\xE7in \xF6nemli olduklar\u0131n\u0131
    ve sana \xE7ok de\u011Fer vermeye ba\u015Flad\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131 dile getiriyor.
    Onlardan g\xFCzel haberler duymaya, m\xFCjdeler almaya ba\u015Flam\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n.
    S\u0131cac\u0131k ve \xE7ok samimi ili\u015Fkiler kurmu\u015Fsun. Mutlu tesad\xFCfler
    ve do\u011Fru insani ili\u015Fkiler, seni \xF6zledi\u011Fin de\u011Ferlerle bulu\u015Fturmaya
    ba\u015Flam\u0131\u015F."
